# WARP-8: SEQ's CLEAR on the kit clears the picked drum's lane only; HOME's list clears the whole pattern; CLEAR
# SCENE takes the scene's notes with it. A black key is heard as it picks its drum, while the pattern plays too
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
expect page Steps
# a kick on 1 and 9, a snare on 5 and 13
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w8
tapkey b1
tapkey w4
tapkey w12
expect note 1 1 1 1
expect note 1 1 5 2
# the snare picked: CLEAR (notes) takes its hits and leaves the kick's (a pause first: the undo's own step)
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 40
row CLEAR
tap SEL
wait 40
said CLEARED HITS OF
expect note 1 1 5 0
expect note 1 1 13 0
expect note 1 1 1 1
expect note 1 1 9 1
# HOME + REC brings the lane back
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
wait 40
expect note 1 1 5 2
# a black key is heard while it plays: two picks, two hits more than the pattern's
# (two picks heard so far, then step 1's kick; the hat's pick is one more)
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect drumhits 3
tapkey b2
wait 60
expect drumhits 4
tap PLAY
# HOME's list: the whole pattern
tap HOME
tap SEL
wait 40
row CLEAR NOTES AND LOCKS
tap SEL
wait 40
said CLEARED
expect note 1 1 1 0
expect note 1 1 5 0
# CLEAR SCENE: the scene's notes go with it
tap SEQ
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w2
expect note 1 1 1 1
tap HOME
tap SEL
wait 40
row CLEAR SCENE
tap SEL
wait 40
expect ask 1
tap SEL
wait 40
said CLEARED
expect note 1 1 1 0
expect note 1 1 3 0
expect scene 1
